(function(){"use strict";var TITLES={login:"تسجيل الدخول",register:"إنشاء حساب جديد",forgot:"استعادة كلمة المرور",reset:"تعيين كلمة سر جديدة"};var RESET_ERROR="الرابط غير صالح أو انتهت صلاحيته — اطلب رابط جديد.";document.addEventListener("click",function(e){var trigger=e.target.closest("[data-auth-open]");if(!trigger)return;e.preventDefault();document.documentElement.classList.remove("pg-leave");window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent("auth:open",{detail:{mode:trigger.getAttribute("data-auth-open")||"login"}}));var drawer=document.getElementById("navDrawer");if(drawer&&drawer.classList.contains("open")){if(typeof window.setMobileNavDrawerOpen==="function"){window.setMobileNavDrawerOpen(false);}else{drawer.classList.remove("open");var burger=document.getElementById("navBurger");if(burger)burger.innerHTML='<i class="fa-solid fa-bars"></i>';}}});document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded",function(){try{var params=new URLSearchParams(location.search);var mode=params.get("auth");if(mode&&TITLES[mode]){var err=params.get("reset_error")?RESET_ERROR:"";params.delete("auth");params.delete("reset_error");var q=params.toString();history.replaceState(null,"",location.pathname+(q?"?"+q:"")+location.hash);window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent("auth:open",{detail:{mode:mode,error:err}}));}}catch(e){}});document.addEventListener("click",function(e){var toggle=e.target.closest("#navAccountToggle");var menu=toggle&&toggle.closest(".nav-pages-menu");if(menu){var isOpen=menu.classList.toggle("open");toggle.setAttribute("aria-expanded",String(isOpen));return;}
document.querySelectorAll(".nav-pages-menu.open #navAccountToggle").forEach(function(t){var m=t.closest(".nav-pages-menu");if(m&&!m.contains(e.target)){m.classList.remove("open");t.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false");}});});document.addEventListener("keydown",function(e){if(e.key!=="Escape")return;document.querySelectorAll(".nav-pages-menu.open #navAccountToggle").forEach(function(t){var m=t.closest(".nav-pages-menu");if(m){m.classList.remove("open");t.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false");}});});window.authOverlay=function(){return{open:false,mode:"login",busy:false,error:"",notice:"",pageUrl:"/",_lastFocus:null,get title(){return TITLES[this.mode]||TITLES.login;},init:function(){var self=this;window.addEventListener("auth:open",function(ev){self.show(ev.detail&&ev.detail.mode,ev.detail&&ev.detail.error);});this.$watch("open",function(v){document.documentElement.classList.toggle("auth-overlay-open",v);});},show:function(mode,err){this.mode=TITLES[mode]?mode:"login";this.error=err||"";this.notice="";this.pageUrl=location.pathname+location.search;if(!this.open)this._lastFocus=document.activeElement;this.open=true;var self=this;this.$nextTick(function(){var panel=document.querySelector('[data-auth-panel="'+self.mode+'"]');var field=panel&&panel.querySelector("input:not([type=hidden])");var target=field||self.$refs.closeBtn;if(target&&target.focus)target.focus();});},setMode:function(mode){this.show(mode);},close:function(){if(!this.open)return;this.open=false;this.error="";this.notice="";var last=this._lastFocus;if(last&&last.focus&&document.contains(last))last.focus();},trapTab:function(e){if(!this.open)return;var dlg=this.$refs.dialog;if(!dlg)return;var items=dlg.querySelectorAll('a[href], button:not([disabled]), input:not([type=hidden]):not([disabled]), [tabindex]:not([tabindex="-1"])');var focusables=Array.prototype.filter.call(items,function(el){return el.offsetParent!==null;});if(!focusables.length)return;var first=focusables[0];var last=focusables[focusables.length-1];if(e.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===first){e.preventDefault();last.focus();}
else if(!e.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===last){e.preventDefault();first.focus();}
else if(!dlg.contains(document.activeElement)){e.preventDefault();first.focus();}},submit:function(kind){if(this.busy)return;var form=this.$refs["form_"+kind];if(!form)return;this.busy=true;this.error="";this.notice="";var fd=new FormData(form);fd.set("next",location.pathname+location.search);var headers={"Accept":"application/json"};if(window.CSRF_TOKEN)headers["X-CSRF-Token"]=window.CSRF_TOKEN;var self=this;fetch(form.action,{method:"POST",headers:headers,body:fd}).then(function(r){return r.json().catch(function(){return{ok:false};}).then(function(d){return{status:r.status,data:d};});}).then(function(res){self.busy=false;if(res.status===200&&res.data&&res.data.ok){if(kind==="forgot"){self.notice=res.data.message;return;}
self._afterAuth(res.data);return;}
self.error=(res.data&&res.data.error)||"حصل خطأ — جرّب تاني.";}).catch(function(){self.busy=false;self.error="مشكلة في الاتصال — تأكد من النت وجرب تاني.";});},_afterAuth:function(data){var self=this;if(window.showToast&&data.message){try{window.showToast("success",data.message);}catch(e){}}
var page=encodeURIComponent(location.pathname+location.search);fetch("/account/nav-fragment?page="+page,{headers:{"Accept":"application/json"}}).then(function(r){return r.json();}).then(function(frag){document.querySelectorAll('[data-nav-auth="links"]').forEach(function(el){el.innerHTML=frag.links;});document.querySelectorAll('[data-nav-auth="drawer"]').forEach(function(el){el.innerHTML=frag.drawer;});document.querySelectorAll('[data-nav-auth="mobile"]').forEach(function(el){el.innerHTML=frag.mobile;});self.close();}).catch(function(){location.reload();});}};};})();